{"slug":"sample-recon-helper","title":"Sample Project: A Small Recon Notes Helper","date":"2026-09-15","updated":null,"description":"A template for a personal-project post: the problem, the design, a short script that creates a per-target notes directory, and what to improve next.","category":"project","platform":null,"difficulty":null,"tags":["bash","tooling","sample"],"featured":true,"cover":null,"readingTime":1,"html":"<aside class=\"callout callout-note\" role=\"note\"><p class=\"callout-title\">Note</p>\n<p><strong>Sample content.</strong> This describes a small illustrative script, not a released tool. Replace it with your own projects.</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"the-problem\">The problem<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" href=\"#the-problem\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Every lab target needs the same directory skeleton. Creating it by hand is a small tax that adds up, and inconsistent layouts make older notes hard to find.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-script\">The script<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" href=\"#the-script\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-header\"><span class=\"code-lang\">bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code to clipboard\" data-copy=\"\">Copy</button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">#!/usr/bin/env bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">set</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -euo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> pipefail</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">target</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">${1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">:?</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">usage</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> newbox</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">name</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">ip</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">}</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">ip</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">${2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">:?</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">usage</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> newbox</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">name</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">ip</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">}</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">mkdir</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> \"labs/</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">$target</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"/{scans,loot}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">cat</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> ></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> \"labs/</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">$target</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">/notes.md\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">EOF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"># </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">$target</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">$ip</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">## Timeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">EOF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">echo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">$ip</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> ></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> \"labs/</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">$target</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">/ip.txt\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">echo</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\"> \"created labs/</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">$target</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-header\"><span class=\"code-lang\">console</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code to clipboard\" data-copy=\"\">Copy</button></div><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"console\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">$ ./newbox lantern 10.10.11.50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">created labs/lantern</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"design-choices\">Design choices<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" href=\"#design-choices\">#</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Plain files and Bash: nothing to install on a fresh VM.</li>\n<li><code>set -euo pipefail</code> so typos fail loudly.</li>\n<li>No network access: the script only creates local files.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"next-steps\">Next steps<a class=\"heading-anchor\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" href=\"#next-steps\">#</a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Add an optional first-pass scan.</li>\n<li>Generate a notes template per platform.</li>\n<li>Add tests with <code>bats</code>.</li>\n</ol>","toc":[{"depth":2,"id":"the-problem","text":"The problem"},{"depth":2,"id":"the-script","text":"The script"},{"depth":2,"id":"design-choices","text":"Design choices"},{"depth":2,"id":"next-steps","text":"Next steps"}],"prev":null,"next":{"slug":"linux-privilege-escalation-checklist","title":"Linux Privilege Escalation Checklist"},"related":["htb-sample-lantern","thm-sample-sql-injection-room","offsec-lab-methodology-notes"]}